will utilize an AudioScience 5044
(http://www.audioscience.com/internet/products/sound_cards/asi504x.htm)
which has four stereo inputs and four stereo outputs (8 channels in
either direction). The software of course needs to support consumer
cards as well. So I have to determine what type of card is connected,
and what inputs are available.

